From 3fb5fdfa4322e3c3d05447c77a6ce4b190ae3a44 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Junction 2026 team <junction2026@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 04:23:39 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] feat: say when a label change is saved but snapshots.csv
 lags behind

When PATCH changes state.json but cannot rewrite snapshots.csv (it answers
200, and the next capture or download repairs the CSV), the response now has
csv_warning saying so, and the recent snapshots list shows it as a toast.
csv_warning is null otherwise.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
